{
  "id": "thermal_transmittance_vs__thermal_resistance",
  "title": "Thermal Transmittance vs. Thermal Resistance",
  "description": "Calculator for thermal transmittance (U) and thermal resistance (R). Thermal transmittance is the inverse of thermal resistance. For layered constructions, the overall thermal transmittance is 1 divided by the sum of individual thermal resistances.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Thermal Transmittance vs. Thermal Resistance\n\nThermal transmittance and thermal resistance are inversely related:\n\n**U = 1 / R** (Equation 1)\n\nWhere:\n- **U** = overall thermal transmittance (W/m² °C)\n- **R** = overall thermal resistance (m² °C/W)\n\nFor layered constructions with multiple thermal resistances:\n\n**U = 1 / ΣRi** (Equation 2)\n\nExample - Heat Exchanger:\nU = 1 / (R_air film + R_condensate film + R_metal wall + R_product film)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Single Value Calculations"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "thermal_resistance",
          "label": "Thermal Resistance (R)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "defaultValue": 0.5
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "thermal_transmittance_from_r",
          "label": "Thermal Transmittance (U)",
          "unit": "W/m² °C",
          "formula": "1 / inputs.thermal_resistance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Reverse Calculation"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "thermal_transmittance",
          "label": "Thermal Transmittance (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/m² °C",
          "defaultValue": 2
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "thermal_resistance_from_u",
          "label": "Thermal Resistance (R)",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "formula": "1 / inputs.thermal_transmittance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Layered Construction"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "resistance_layer_1",
          "label": "Layer 1 Resistance",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "defaultValue": 0.1
        },
        {
          "id": "resistance_layer_2",
          "label": "Layer 2 Resistance",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "defaultValue": 0.2
        },
        {
          "id": "resistance_layer_3",
          "label": "Layer 3 Resistance",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "defaultValue": 0.15
        },
        {
          "id": "resistance_layer_4",
          "label": "Layer 4 Resistance",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_resistance",
          "label": "Total Thermal Resistance (ΣRi)",
          "unit": "m² °C/W",
          "formula": "inputs.resistance_layer_1 + inputs.resistance_layer_2 + inputs.resistance_layer_3 + inputs.resistance_layer_4"
        },
        {
          "id": "overall_transmittance",
          "label": "Overall Thermal Transmittance (U)",
          "unit": "W/m² °C",
          "formula": "1 / (inputs.resistance_layer_1 + inputs.resistance_layer_2 + inputs.resistance_layer_3 + inputs.resistance_layer_4)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}